तयोर्न वशमागच्छेत्तौ ह्यस्य परिपन्थिनौ ॥ ३४ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1194,\"bb\":1060,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/34/b1060/\",\"body_value\":\"indriyasyendriyasyārthe
