para-dharmo bhayāvahaḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1201,\"bb\":1066,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/35/b1066/\",\"shadow_value\":\"śreyān – far better; sva-dharmaḥ – one’s prescribed duties; viguṇaḥ – even faulty; para-dharmāt – than duties mentioned for others; su-anuṣṭhitāt – perfectly done; sva-dharme – in one’s prescribed duties; nidhanam – destruction; śreyaḥ – better; para-dharmaḥ – duties prescribed for others; bhaya-āvahaḥ – dangerous.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"śreyān\",\"translation\":\"far better\"},{\"word\":\"sva-dharmaḥ\",\"translation\":\"one’s prescribed duties\"},{\"word\":\"viguṇaḥ\",\"translation\":\"even faulty\"},{\"word\":\"para-dharmāt\",\"translation\":\"than duties mentioned for others\"},{\"word\":\"su-anuṣṭhitāt\",\"translation\":\"perfectly done\"},{\"word\":\"sva-dharme\",\"translation\":\"in one’s prescribed duties\"},{\"word\":\"nidhanam\",\"translation\":\"destruction\"},{\"word\":\"śreyaḥ\",\"translation\":\"better\"},{\"word\":\"para-dharmaḥ\",\"translation\":\"duties prescribed for others\"},{\"word\":\"bhaya-āvahaḥ\",\"translation\":\"dangerous\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1202,\"bb\":1067,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/35/b1067/\",\"body_value\":\"It is far better to discharge one’s prescribed duties, even though faultily, than another’s duties perfectly. Destruction in the course of performing one’s own duty is better than engaging in another’s duties, for to follow another’s path is dangerous.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1203,\"bb\":1068,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/35/b1068/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 3.35\",\"medium_title\":\"B